  fix: write `spin`
  `write `spin`` gives: object @d "D"\nlight @l "L" {\n  type point\n  energy driver="spin * 100W" {\n    var spin transforms { target @d transform-type=rot-z }\n  }\n}\n
--- object @d "D"\nlight @l "L" {\n  type point\n  energy driver="atan2(spin)" {\n    var spin transforms { target @d transform-type=rot-z }\n  }\n}\n
